## Overall Pattern Summary

| Aspect | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **envFrom Usage** | Bulk loads all key-value pairs from ConfigMaps and Secrets as environment variables |
| **ConfigMaps Referenced** | `next-search-common-config`, `cmn-search-admin-config` (default), `dev-cmn-search-admin-config` (dev) |
| **Secrets Referenced** | `common-elasticsearch-dev-credentials` (dev environment only) |
| **ConfigMap Creation** | Only one local ConfigMap is created (`cmn-search-admin-config`), but it's NOT used in envFrom |
| **Multi-Container Support** | Each container can have different envFrom configurations |
| **Environment Variations** | Dev environment adds secret reference that default doesn't have |
| **External Secrets** | Configured via `externalSecrets` values, possibly for External Secrets Operator |

All files have been provided with complete paths and contents above.
